From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hans2294 <22217531+hans2294@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 19:38:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linuxkpi: Linux kernel API on Haiku's kernel

A compat layer in the spirit of FreeBSD's LinuxKPI: Linux headers and functions
on Haiku's kernel, enough for Linux 6.12's amdgpu, DRM and TTM, unchanged.
Linux fds are real Haiku fds, so dma-bufs and sync files work.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
